{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_042_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6138ad75f7b33c97d3ffa0be4ad63ba19c4ec1418830577f29943523923fa76a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f28a8543ed70ffb2fa29341f163b2c65fbdf4544315da6cad90470cab4513d3",
      "text": "其、其实俺怕老鼠啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b48913912fb571b4e44631edea4e685dc3c9ec087ee7d8acda79aedc9871b76",
      "text": "原来是这样吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a69e33402ea22327263eeb4d8d76535f1978460c550ddd5f248898862cf0b80f",
      "text": "闹得这么大真是不好意思……\n俺怎么都应付不来那家伙……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45ddbca078f9b460e904604c60218db3eaadbd2a9f13071be21df5467d73b32e",
      "text": "仓库里总是少不了老鼠的吧。\n所以俺才稍微琢磨得出了神。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29e95b58d7256b9beb083001905e7a6e03e9b4111cd235b4dd3df2a64aff4839",
      "text": "要是拍摄的时候老鼠跑出来，就拜托你支援了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d0586a3b3c27e607993e89d1dad327bb111e09edf67f898a6579041d0bfbfe0",
      "text": "如果是这样的话，请不要勉强自己。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48e6bccedd73b294f2d1181b14930c4ec9672fc7f2d65894ad781daab5041882",
      "text": "别啊，让俺做吧！\n俺想回应选择了俺的人的心意！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e6edc1d988221b1104dbd6df7a89fa70b10658b5a7ad8a828af4eb4d5746041",
      "text": "……我知道了。那么，这项工作就继续推进。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c1b9db79dde2bf4c5c55dac3c68c2959743fef3d46605a8266bc26b317a8449",
      "text": "谢谢你啊，Boss！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:540dc3a47b06eb5b895caa63319f24522c604e094fef3ded417303ddb4f18d9f",
      "text": "但是，绝对不能勉强。要是觉得受不了，\n请当场提出来哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb72f4cf9192119b7d4e3e2dc96dd25ed600cdb8c5cb9abc548841d104b1f185",
      "text": "哦，那是自然！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
